<title>USA: Wichita, Kan. $5.535 mln won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Wichita, Kan. $5.535 mln won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $5.535 million of Wichita, Kan., general obligation bonds, Series 747, with a net interest cost of 4.74 percent.</p>
</text>
